      "start_seconds": 1.1,
      "end_seconds": 5.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.98,
      "end_seconds": 10.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.44,
      "end_seconds": 17.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "It's itchy watery eyes. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.49,
      "end_seconds": 22.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.91,
      "end_seconds": 30.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "It's been about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.94,
      "end_seconds": 37.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.91,
      "end_seconds": 44.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Cold compress helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.09,
      "end_seconds": 65.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Have you had any light sensitivity, pain in the eye or contact lens?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.49,
      "end_seconds": 70.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "no, um, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.79,
      "end_seconds": 74.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.42,
      "end_seconds": 81.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "nothing unusual, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.7,
      "end_seconds": 86.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.87,
      "end_seconds": 88.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.7,
      "end_seconds": 91.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.18,
      "end_seconds": 94.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.7,
      "end_seconds": 97.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.96,
      "end_seconds": 101.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.03,
      "end_seconds": 105.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.31,
      "end_seconds": 111.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.14,
      "end_seconds": 115.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.63,
      "end_seconds": 120.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.05,
      "end_seconds": 125.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.48,
      "end_seconds": 131.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I take omeprazole, 20 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.12,
      "end_seconds": 149.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "Alright, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.64,
      "end_seconds": 153.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "no, I've never reacted to anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.82,
      "end_seconds": 163.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.84,
      "end_seconds": 168.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for about a year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.65,
      "end_seconds": 174.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Yes. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.66,
      "end_seconds": 185.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.14,
      "end_seconds": 204.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.25,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 99 percent, pulse 65, pressure 108 over 80, temperature is 36.5 degrees, respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.93,
      "end_seconds": 207.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.1,
      "end_seconds": 212.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.68,
      "end_seconds": 216.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.73,
      "end_seconds": 218.7,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.31,
      "end_seconds": 221.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.82,
      "end_seconds": 243.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Both eyes are pink with clear watery discharge and no sticky pus"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.16,
      "end_seconds": 251.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.2,
      "end_seconds": 269.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.86,
      "text": "let me tell you where I've got to i can't pin this down yet we're looking at allergic conjunctivitis or infective conjunctivitis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.6,
      "end_seconds": 275.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.95,
      "end_seconds": 294.25,
      "duration_seconds": 16.3,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like allergic conjunctivitis. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had itchy watery eyes for about four days, severe, and no pain in the eye or light sensitivity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.92,
      "end_seconds": 296.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.99,
      "end_seconds": 319.77,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "today I'm not changing anything right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.51,
      "end_seconds": 324.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    }
  ]
